&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8C_9n3GjpXUQ7kNvwEf6Usc&_nc_oc=AdkKRbhqQcGdFQvHP7BAV0WP16dbXlxeOfKWfgU5w7Gx-D4RkGSpV37d-6Z01GQ0Sws&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxwmgfox7IjJVRnV-7AXYaYGv1XBetzH-EC6NEvCt628w&oe=69AABD0C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer_cover.png", "id": "853816492160058", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003248_853816495493391_1038613569093630295_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jGnut2gHRZMQ7kNvwHQBqs9&_nc_oc=Adl6s4QLxF-FmSSIp3cOifeCOP78-x4YLA-nFuRcAKWUzvgF2HYDt-0YP7OvhgepJAk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyf0BVwn0CTQ7qXQ0LfK5rAyGTyaVX4KqBW-KWTqrbpzg&oe=69AADD8E"}, "display_name": "VR Pigeons", "keywords": [], "long_description": "All the world\u2019s a rooftop, and all the men and women merely pigeons. \n\nUse the power of VR and absolutely unique movement controls to slip into your pigeon-self!\nGo out into the world and find a rooftop. Wait for the granny to throw some bread. Eat as much bread as possible! BREAD IS LIFE!\n\n\nHow to become the ultimate VR Pigeon:\n\n\u2022 Channel to your inner Pigeon. Bob your head like a pigeon in order to move around and interact with your world\n\u2022 Unlock and discover four different levels\n\u2022 Protect your bread from other pigeons\n\u2022 Use power-ups and map shortcuts to be faster than other pigeons\n\u2022 Your pigeon enemies come in different shapes, avoid unnecessary conflicts!", "short_description": "All the world\u2019s a rooftop, and all the men and women merely pigeons. \n\nUse the power of VR and absolutely unique movement controls to slip into your pigeon-self!\nGo out into the world and find a rooftop. Wait for the granny to throw some bread. Eat as much bread as possible! BREAD IS LIFE!"}]}, "developer_name": "Maestro Pivetta", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vrkiwi.org/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/VR-Pigeons-EULA.pdf", "developer_